1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,495
Tonight,

2
00:00:02,545 --> 00:00:04,299
seven vampires vote on whether I get to live.

3
00:00:04,369 --> 00:00:05,299
And honestly?

4
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:07,036
Hollywood started it.

5
00:00:07,266 --> 00:00:08,841
In every vampire film,

6
00:00:08,891 --> 00:00:10,784
she was the hottest one there.

7
00:00:10,834 --> 00:00:12,224
So that became my type.

8
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:12,979
Pale.

9
00:00:13,029 --> 00:00:13,809
Black lace.

10
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,164
Hates mornings.

11
00:00:15,314 --> 00:00:16,969
Eight years of goth nights.

12
00:00:17,019 --> 00:00:17,973
Nothing.

13
00:00:18,123 --> 00:00:20,123
Then, three weeks ago, there she was.

14
00:00:20,173 --> 00:00:21,406
Not drinking.

15
00:00:21,557 --> 00:00:22,412
At my door,

16
00:00:22,462 --> 00:00:24,538
she asked me to invite her in.

17
00:00:24,588 --> 00:00:26,465
I thought that was flirting.

18
00:00:26,695 --> 00:00:27,860
I opened the wine.

19
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:30,017
The glass broke in my hand.

20
00:00:30,087 --> 00:00:31,012
She said sorry.

21
00:00:31,062 --> 00:00:32,494
She said it a lot.

22
00:00:32,883 --> 00:00:34,223
I woke at sunset.

23
00:00:34,273 --> 00:00:36,418
My watch couldn't find a pulse.

24
00:00:36,649 --> 00:00:38,724
Under the door,

25
00:00:38,774 --> 00:00:39,649
a black envelope.

26
00:00:39,699 --> 00:00:40,384
Made without permission.

27
00:00:40,434 --> 00:00:41,865
Present yourself.

28
00:00:42,014 --> 00:00:43,189
They have rules.

29
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:45,573
No turning anyone without a vote.

30
00:00:45,623 --> 00:00:47,558
And no one finds out.

31
00:00:47,708 --> 00:00:50,884
Then the eldest slid my phone across the table.

32
00:00:50,934 --> 00:00:52,409
My story from that night.

33
00:00:52,459 --> 00:00:53,594
Two glasses.

34
00:00:53,644 --> 00:00:55,130
Nobody next to me.

35
00:00:55,599 --> 00:00:57,821
Three hundred people watched it.

36
00:00:58,131 --> 00:00:59,356
She's at the far end.

37
00:00:59,406 --> 00:01:01,190
She hasn't looked at me once.

38
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,973
It's three votes each.

39
00:01:03,043 --> 00:01:04,871
The last one is hers.

40
00:01:05,421 --> 00:01:06,403
Sorry.
